{
  "id": "contract.clauses_1_3",
  "role": "document",
  "content": {
    "type": "container",
    "value": {
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "contract.section_1",
          "role": "heading",
          "variant": "section",
          "keep_with_next": true,
          "content": { "type": "text", "value": "1. 服务内容" },
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "contract.clause_1",
          "role": "contract_clause",
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "承包方应按附件所述专业标准提供服务，并以本文件条款为准。服务应在约定日期内完成，质量不得低于行业通常要求。双方确认：纸面以本协议锁定版为准，口头承诺不构成变更。"
          },
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "contract.section_2",
          "role": "heading",
          "variant": "section",
          "keep_with_next": true,
          "content": { "type": "text", "value": "2. 报酬与发票" },
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "contract.clause_2",
          "role": "contract_clause",
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "客户应于收到发票后三十日内支付约定金额。对账单与发票金额如有差异，以本协议签署栏所确认数字为准。延迟支付不免除客户的付款义务。"
          },
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "contract.section_3",
          "role": "heading",
          "variant": "section",
          "keep_with_next": true,
          "content": { "type": "text", "value": "3. 机密与阅读范围" },
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "id": "contract.clause_3",
          "role": "contract_clause",
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "本协议仅供签署人阅读。接收方不得将摘要、条款、金额或附件转交未获书面准许的第三方。违反本条视为重大违约，守约方可立即终止本文件项下服务并要求赔偿。"
          },
          "modifiers": []
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
